;;; =====================================================================
;;; (11) FUBINI FOR A RECTANGLE: x |-> nu((aa x bb)_x) is nu(bb) 1_aa, whose
;;;      integral is nu(bb) mu(aa) (integral-homogeneous, integral-indicator).
